msgid ""
"`hardware:=mock_components` / `gz` / `isaac` are launch keys, not vendor "
"driver-layer packages under `hardwares/`. Plugin table: [ros2_control in "
"This Stack](../../3-concepts/1-ros2_control_here.md). Isaac topic "
"`<param>` names: [Driver layer "
"parameters](../../4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md)."
msgstr ""
"`hardware:=mock_components` / `gz` / `isaac` 是 launch 键，不是 `hardwares/` 下的厂商驱动层包。插件表：[本栈中的 "
"ros2_control](../../3-concepts/1-ros2_control_here.md)。Isaac 话题 `<param>` 名：[驱动层参数](../../4-reference/hardware/4-ros2_parameters.md)。"

